      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793813514151,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Software API\nPOST /license\n\n201 Created\nTHERE IS A LICENSE.\n  \n\nYou cannot return a license. Period. Can't do it.\nYou can return a \"guess\"\n\nPOST /license-requests\n\n\"hey, it looks good right now. We'll get back to you in a bit\"\n\nGET /licenses\n\n\n\n\nSteve Klabnik - \"Most api design problems are solved by adding a new resource\"\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Software API\nPOST /license\n\n201 Created\nTHERE IS A LICENSE.\n  \n\nYou cannot return a license. Period. Can't do it.\nYou can return a \"guess\"\n\nPOST /license-requests\n\n\"hey, it looks good right now. We'll get back to you in a bit\"\n\nGET /licenses\n\n\n\n\nSteve Klabnik - \"Most api design problems are solved by adding a new resource\"\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
